        gutprop:Species ;
    rdfs:label "Microorganism" ;
    rdfs:comment "A microscopic organism. The term microorganism may refer to a prokaryote or eukaryote, and may be a unicellular or multicellular organism. All taxonomic kingdoms contain microorganisms. [Definition Source: NCIT]",
