    rdfs:label "Narcolepsy" ;
    rdfs:comment "A sleep disorder characterized by a tendency for excessive sleepiness during the day which occurs even after adequate sleep in the nighttime. The persons who suffer from this condition experience fatigue and may fall asleep at inappropriate times during the day. [Definition Source: NCIT]",
        "NCIT Match" ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/schema/conceptScheme/DiseaseDisorderOrFinding> ;
