        <https://w3id.org/brainteaser/ontology/schema/DiseaseDisorderOrFinding> ;
    rdfs:label "Acne Vulgaris" ;
    rdfs:comment "Acne_vulgaris is a type of chronic inflammatory skin condition characterized by the formation of comedones (blackheads and whiteheads), papules, pustules, nodules, and cysts, typically affecting the face, chest, and back. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]",
