    rdfs:label "Orbital Diseases" ;
    rdfs:comment "Orbital Diseases: A collective term referring to various medical conditions affecting the orbit, including inflammatory, neoplastic, and traumatic disorders that can impact the eye, surrounding tissues, and adjacent structures. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]"^^xsd:string,
