    rdfs:comment "Aromatic Amino Acid Aminotransferase is an enzyme that catalyzes the transfer of an amino group from an aromatic amino acid to 2-oxoglutarate, resulting in the formation of glutamate and an aromatic keto acid. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]"^^xsd:string,
