    rdfs:comment "Epigallocatechin Gallate is a polyphenolic compound found in green tea, specifically the galloylated form of epigallocatechin, which has been studied for its potential health benefits and antioxidant properties. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]"^^xsd:string,
