    rdfs:comment "The entity \"csgA_protein,_E_coli\" refers to the major subunit of the curli protein complex, a type of amyloid fiber produced by Escherichia coli (E. coli) bacteria. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]",
        "UMLS Match" ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/schema/conceptScheme/Gene> ;
