    rdfs:label "Impaired Cognition" ;
    rdfs:comment "Impaired Cognition: A condition characterized by a decline or disruption in normal cognitive processes, such as attention, memory, language, or problem-solving abilities, resulting in difficulties with daily functioning and decision-making. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]"^^xsd:string,
