    rdfs:comment "Endocannabinoids are endogenously produced lipid-based neurotransmitters that bind to cannabinoid receptors in the brain and peripheral tissues, playing a role in various physiological processes, including pain modulation, mood regulation, and appetite control. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]"^^xsd:string,
