    rdfs:comment "A multiplex electrochemiluminescence immunoassay is a laboratory test that uses electrochemiluminescence technology to detect and quantify multiple analytes simultaneously in a single sample, utilizing antibodies and chemiluminescent labels to produce a luminescent signal. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]",
