    dcterms:creator "Samuel Piron" ;
    rdfs:comment "Aav-shrna refers to a type of gene therapy vector that uses adeno-associated virus (AAV) to deliver short hairpin RNA (shRNA) molecules to target cells, thereby silencing specific genes. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]" ;
