        gutprop:BiomedicalTechnique ;
    rdfs:label "Blastn Analysis" ;
    dcterms:creator "Samuel Piron" ;
    rdfs:comment "Blastn_analysis refers to a bioinformatic analysis that uses the BLASTN algorithm to compare a query nucleotide sequence against a database of nucleotide sequences to identify regions of similarity and potential functional relationships. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]" ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/schema/conceptScheme/BiomedicalTechnique> ;
    gutprop:containedIn <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/mention/29e8196229fb4a25> .

<https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/biomedicaltechnique/BurstTesting> a owl:NamedIndividual,
