    dcterms:creator "Samuel Piron" ;
    rdfs:comment "Gastrointestinal and microbiome profiling refers to the analysis of the composition and diversity of the gut microbiome and its relationship with the gastrointestinal tract to understand its role in human health and disease. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]" ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/schema/conceptScheme/BiomedicalTechnique> ;
