    dcterms:creator "Samuel Piron" ;
    rdfs:comment "A predictive analysis method is a systematic approach used to forecast or estimate a future outcome or behavior based on statistical models, machine learning algorithms, or other analytical techniques applied to historical data. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]" ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/schema/conceptScheme/StatisticalTechnique> ;
