        <https://w3id.org/brainteaser/ontology/schema/DiseaseDisorderOrFinding> ;
    rdfs:label "Atherosclerosis" ;
    rdfs:comment "Build-up of fatty material and calcium deposition in the arterial wall resulting in partial or complete occlusion of the arterial lumen. [Definition Source: NCIT]",
        "NCIT Match" ;
