    rdfs:label "Neuromyelitis Optica" ;
    rdfs:comment "An autoimmune inflammatory syndrome characterized by optic neuritis and myelitis. Signs and symptoms include loss of vision, weakness and paralysis of the extremities, and loss of sensation. [Definition Source: NCIT]",
