    rdfs:label "Sleep Disorders, Circadian Rhythm" ;
    rdfs:comment "OMIT Match",
        "Sleep_and_circadian_rhythm_disruption refers to a condition characterized by disturbances in the normal sleep-wake cycle and the body's natural circadian rhythm, leading to impaired sleep quality, fatigue, and other related symptoms. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]" ;
