    rdfs:label "Genes, Regulator" ;
    rdfs:comment "Genes which regulate or circumscribe the activity of other genes; specifically, genes which code for PROTEINS or RNAs which have GENE EXPRESSION REGULATION functions. [Definition Source: UMLS]",
