        <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/resource/mention/c3e608db961fcf8d> .

<https://uts.nlm.nih.gov/uts/umls/concept/C5392082> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        skos:Concept,
        gutprop:BiomedicalTechnique ;
    rdfs:label "Elevated Plus Maze Test" ;
    rdfs:comment "A maze test in which an animal is placed on the center of elevated platform and is allowed to choose one of four arms configured like a plus sign. Animals are inherently wary of open elevated areas and tend to avoid the open arms. [Definition Source: UMLS]",
        "UMLS Match" ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/hereditary/ontology/gutbrain/schema/conceptScheme/BiomedicalTechnique> ;
