    rdfs:label "Obsessive Compulsive Disorder" ;
    rdfs:comment "A disorder characterized by the presence of persistent and recurrent irrational thoughts (obsessions), resulting in marked anxiety and repetitive excessive behaviors (compulsions) as a way to try to decrease that anxiety. [Definition Source: NCIT]",
