        <https://w3id.org/brainteaser/ontology/schema/DiseaseDisorderOrFinding> ;
    rdfs:label "Autism" ;
    rdfs:comment "A disorder characterized by marked impairments in social interaction and communication accompanied by a pattern of repetitive, stereotyped behaviors and activities. Developmental delays in social interaction and language surface prior to age 3 years. [Definition Source: NCIT]",
