    rdfs:label "Behavior" ;
    rdfs:comment "More_externalizing_behavior refers to a behavioral pattern characterized by the expression of emotions, impulses, or conflicts through actions or physical manifestations outside the individual, such as aggression, substance use, or self-harm. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]",
