        <https://w3id.org/brainteaser/ontology/schema/DiseaseDisorderOrFinding> ;
    rdfs:label "Coeliac Disease" ;
    rdfs:comment "Coeliac disease is a chronic autoimmune disorder characterized by intolerance to gluten, primarily affecting the small intestine and causing malabsorption of nutrients. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]",
