    rdfs:label "Behavioural And Psychiatric Symptoms Of Dementia" ;
    rdfs:comment "\"Behavioural And Psychiatric Symptoms Of Dementia\" refers to a set of neuropsychiatric symptoms that occur in individuals with dementia, including agitation, aggression, anxiety, apathy, depression, and psychosis. [Definition Source: llama3-8b-8192]"^^xsd:string,
