    rdfs:label "Flavonifractor" ;
    rdfs:comment "A genus of strictly anaerobic, Gram-variable, bacillus-shaped bacteria with variable motility in the family Firmicutes. Bacteria in the genus are asaccharolytic and weakly fermentative on glucose, fructose, and ribose. [Definition Source: UMLS]",
        "UMLS Match" ;
